# The middle range `10³⁶ ≤ K < 10¹⁰⁰` of the effective measure (Gelfond L11)

For `10³⁶ ≤ K < 10¹⁰⁰` the bound `exp(−K/2⁸⁰) < |p log 2 − K log 3|` needs no transcendence input.
Consecutive convergents of `δ = log₂ 3` are Farey neighbours `a/b < δ < c/d`; for `K < b + d` every
